                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2L4 5v6.09c0 5.05 3.41 9.76 8 10.91 4.59-1.15 8-5.86 8-10.91V5l-8-3z"/></svg>
